@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceToken = mock-device-token
@deviceId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@stationId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@returnAttemptId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### AI 얼굴 인증 성공
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/kiosk-authentications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Idempotency-Key: 81000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

< ./v1/face-auth-success.json

### AI 얼굴 인증 실패
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/kiosk-authentications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Idempotency-Key: 81000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

< ./v1/face-auth-failure.json

### AI 파손 판정 결과
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/return-attempts/{{returnAttemptId}}/inspection-results
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Idempotency-Key: 82000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

< ./v1/damage-result.json

### 슬롯 센서 이벤트 - 점유
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/device-operations/90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/events
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Idempotency-Key: 91000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

< ./v1/slot-sensor-occupied.json

### 슬롯 센서 이벤트 - 비점유
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/device-operations/90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/events
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
Idempotency-Key: 91000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

< ./v1/slot-sensor-empty.json

### 잠금 명령 성공
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/device-operations/90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/events
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
Idempotency-Key: 91000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

< ./v1/lock-success.json

### 잠금 명령 실패
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/device-operations/90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004/events
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
Idempotency-Key: 91000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

< ./v1/lock-failure.json

### 정상 Heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/stations/{{stationId}}/heartbeats
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
Idempotency-Key: 92000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

< ./v1/heartbeat-normal.json

### 부팅 Snapshot - 서버 기준과 일치
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/stations/{{stationId}}/boot-snapshots
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
Idempotency-Key: a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

< ./v1/boot-snapshot-match.json

### 부팅 Snapshot - 서버 기준과 불일치
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edge/stations/{{stationId}}/boot-snapshots
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
X-Request-Id: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000a
Idempotency-Key: a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

< ./v1/boot-snapshot-mismatch.json
